 registering your domain now. This usually takes a few minutes, so no action is needed right now.'=>'我们正在为您注册域名。此过程通常只需几分钟，因此您目前无需采取任何操作。','What type of products or services will you sell?'=>'你准备销售什么类型的产品或服务？','What’s a plugin?'=>'什么是插件？','What’s a pre-built website?'=>'什么是预建网站？','What’s a theme?'=>'什么是主题？','Where is your store located?'=>'你的商店在哪里？','WordPress tutorials'=>'WordPress 教程 ','WordPress version'=>'WordPress 版本','WP tutorials'=>'WP 教程','Yes, skip step'=>'是，跳过步骤 ','You are running <b>%s</b> PHP version.'=>'你运行的是 <b>%s</b> PHP 版本。','You can also set up a shipping method without installing additional plugins.'=>'你还可以设置发货方式，无需安装其他插件。','You can connect a domain to Hostinger by changing the nameservers. Different domain providers are have unique procedures for changing nameservers. Here are Hostinger\'s nameservers:'=>'你可以通过更改域名服务器将域名连接到Hostinger。不同的域名提供商都有独特的域名服务器更改程序。以下是Hostinger的域名服务器： ','You can see the whole post in the editor. Find the description part and change it to your preferences.'=>'您可以在编辑器中看到完整内容。找到描述部分并进行更改。','You haven’t added a domain to your website. Buy or connect one to give your site its own web address.'=>'您尚未为网站添加域名。请购买或绑定一个域名，为您的网站设置专属网址。','You need to purchase a domain for your website before the preview domain becomes inaccessible. Find a desired website name using a <a style="text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; color:#673de6" target="_blank" href="https://hpanel.hostinger.com/domains/domain-checker" >domain name searcher.</a >'=>'你需要在预览域名无法访问之前为网站购买一个域名。使用 <a style="text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; color:#673de6" target="_blank" href="https://hpanel.hostinger.com/domains/domain-checker">域名搜索器查找所需的网站名称。','You\'ll love these great deals that were handpicked just for you.'=>'您一定会喜欢这些专为您精心挑选的超值优惠。 ','You\'re done setting up your online store!'=>'你已经完成了网店的创建！','Your business email'=>'你的企业电子邮件','Your database has reached its size limit. Clean up unused data or upgrade your plan so your website can keep running smoothly.'=>'您的数据库已达到容量上限。请清理未使用的数据或升级套餐，以确保您的网站能够继续平稳运行。','Your database is close to its size limit. Clean up unused data or upgrade your plan to avoid issues.'=>'您的数据库已接近容量上限。请清理未使用的数据或升级套餐，以避免出现问题。','Your domain'=>'您的域名','Your domain can’t go live until you confirm your email address. Check your inbox and click the verification link we sent you.'=>'在您确认邮箱地址之前，您的域名无法生效。请检查您的收件箱，并点击我们发送给您的验证链接。','Your domain can’t go live until you confirm your phone number. Follow the verification steps to finish setting it up.'=>'在您确认手机号码之前，您的域名无法上线。请按照验证步骤完成设置。','Your domain expired and your website can no longer be reached at this address. Renew it to bring your site back online.'=>'您的域名已过期，无法再通过此地址访问您的网站。请续费以使您的网站恢复正常访问。','Your domain expired but can still be renewed at the normal price for a short time. Renew it now to keep your address and avoid losing it.'=>'您的域名已过期，但在短期内仍可按正常价格续费。请立即续费，以保留您的域名并避免丢失。','Your domain expires soon'=>'您的域名即将到期','Your domain has been temporarily disabled, so your website can’t be reached. This usually happens when required details need to be confirmed. Contact support to get it reactivated.'=>'您的域名已被暂时停用，因此无法访问您的网站。这通常发生在需要确认相关信息时。请联系客服以恢复域名服务。','Your domain has expired'=>'您的域名已过期','Your domain is about to expire. Renew it now to keep your website online and avoid any interruption.'=>'您的域名即将到期。请立即续费，以确保您的网站保持在线状态，避免服务中断。','Your domain is active'=>'您的域名已激活','Your domain is being transferred to Hostinger. This can take a few days to complete, and no action is needed from you right now.'=>'您的域名正在转移至 Hostinger。此过程可能需要几天时间才能完成，目前您无需采取任何行动。','Your domain is registered with another provider and isn’t pointing to your website yet. Update its nameservers or DNS records to connect it.'=>'您的域名是在其他服务商处注册的，目前尚未指向您的网站。请更新其名称服务器或 DNS 记录以将其连接到您的网站。','Your domain is set up and pointing to your website. Visitors can reach your site at this address.'=>'您的域名已设置完毕，并已指向您的网站。访问者可以通过该地址访问您的网站。','Your domain is suspended'=>'您的域名已被暂停','Your domain isn’t pointing to this website yet. Finish 